      "type": "string",
      "string_value": "Not A Fresho Alternative: Voice Ordering Alongside Fresho"
     },
     {
      "prop_id": "d410be85-5d89-9215-6f62-195b0e3f7c44",
      "type": "string",
      "string_value": "VoiceOrder Solutions gives a voice app to the accounts that still call their orders in. They say what they need into the app, look over each line before it goes, and the order arrives in a format you can use now. Whatever you run on Fresho, from AI order reading to the full suite, carries on."
     },
     {
      "prop_id": "5813a60d-8c20-4700-72bd-d80ce9c60b67",
      "type": "string",
      "string_value": "Book a Free Demo"
